* ============================================================================
* 10_table1_descriptives.do — Descriptive statistics (Table 1) for llm_peer
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
* Output: $tables_dir/table1_descriptives.tex (booktabs)
* ============================================================================

version 15
clear all
set more off

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"
capture mkdir "$tables_dir"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

* Variables to summarize: MAIN_DV + main IV/endog + cutoff variants + controls.
local desc_vars {{MAIN_DV}} {{TONE_VAR}} {{LLM_PEER_IV}} {{LLM_PEER_COVERAGE_IV}} {{COMPETE_IDX}} {{CUTOFF_VARS}} $controls

* `estpost summarize` writes a results matrix esttab can format.
estpost summarize `desc_vars', detail

esttab using "$tables_dir/table1_descriptives.tex", replace ///
    cells("count mean(fmt(3)) sd(fmt(3)) min(fmt(3)) p25(fmt(3)) p50(fmt(3)) p75(fmt(3)) max(fmt(3))") ///
    label nomtitle nonumber booktabs ///
    title("Descriptive Statistics --- llm_peer panel") ///
    addnotes("Bank-year panel. {{MAIN_DV}} winsorized at 1%/99% if winsor2 installed.")

display "[OK] Table 1 written to $tables_dir/table1_descriptives.tex"
